{"type":"standard","title":"Udmurt language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Udmurt language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q13238","titles":{"canonical":"Udmurt_language","normalized":"Udmurt language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Udmurt language</span></span>"},"pageid":1137924,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/5.2-Udmurt.png/330px-5.2-Udmurt.png","width":330,"height":292},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/5.2-Udmurt.png","width":2112,"height":1871},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1354166101","tid":"eb983188-4fc4-11f1-bb5f-e37edac197ef","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:44:21Z","description":"Uralic language","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udmurt_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udmurt_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udmurt_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Udmurt_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udmurt_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Udmurt_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Udmurt_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Udmurt_language"}},"extract":"Udmurt is a Permic language spoken by the Udmurt people who are native to Udmurtia. As a Uralic language, it is distantly related to languages such as Finnish, Estonian, Mansi, Khanty, and Hungarian. The Udmurt language is co-official with Russian within Udmurtia.","extract_html":"<p><b>Udmurt</b> is a Permic language spoken by the Udmurt people who are native to Udmurtia. As a Uralic language, it is distantly related to languages such as Finnish, Estonian, Mansi, Khanty, and Hungarian. The Udmurt language is co-official with Russian within Udmurtia.</p>"}